---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---

<Layout
  title="Engine Repair - Taqwa Automobile Service Center"
  description="Expert engine diagnostics and repair in Uttara, Dhaka. Computerized diagnostics, genuine parts, and warranty-backed engine repair at Taqwa Automobile Service Center."
  path="engine-repair.html"
  current="services"
>

<style define:vars={{ heroBg: `url(${base}img/hero-background.jpg)` }}>
  /* Everything shared with the rest of the site (tokens, reset, header,
     mobile nav, buttons/eyebrow, footer, why-choose, our-environment,
     our-features, our-latest-news, services-recap section, hybrid service
     process, the about-style CTA banner, and the shared .hybrid-content/
     .svc-reason-item/.hybrid-illustration selectors) now lives in
     src/styles/global.css. The "car wash", "our services", "our
     environment/features", "story", "stats" and "team" blocks that used to
     be duplicated here were dead CSS — this page never renders those
     sections — and have been dropped. Only the declarations genuinely
     specific to this page remain below. */

  /* Hero image needs the base-path-aware URL (global.css's .hero can't use
     Astro's define:vars); this page's hero paragraph is also a dimmer
     "muted" gray rather than global.css's near-white default. */
  .hero{
    background:
      linear-gradient(rgba(16,19,24,0.65), rgba(16,19,24,0.75)),
      var(--heroBg) center/cover no-repeat;
  }
  .hero-copy p{color:var(--muted);}

  /* This page's header collapses to the hamburger menu at 980px, not
     global.css's default 1024px — restore the full nav in that gap. */
  @media (min-width:981px) and (max-width:1024px){
    nav.main-nav > ul{display:flex;}
    .hamburger{display:none;}
    .call-btn{display:flex;}
  }

  /* This page's hybrid-section reuses the shared .hybrid-content/
     .svc-reason-item pattern with its own background-glow position and a
     wider hybrid-grid/hybrid-features-strip than the homepage's default. */
  .hybrid-panel::before{mask-image:radial-gradient(ellipse 60% 70% at 75% 50%, black, transparent);}
  .hybrid-grid{gap:26px 22px;}
  .hybrid-features-strip{grid-template-columns:repeat(6, 1fr);}

  /* This page's FAQ accordion uses a snappier, non-eased transition than the
     smoother default in global.css — preserved exactly as before. */
  .faq-question{transition:none;}
  .faq-question .faq-arrow::before, .faq-question .faq-arrow::after{
    transition:transform .25s ease, opacity .25s ease;
  }
  .faq-answer{transition:max-height .3s ease;}

  /* This page's inner-page banner uses a real photo background instead of
     global.css's default subtle grid-texture, plus its own fixed sizing. */
  .page-banner{
    background:linear-gradient(150deg, #18263A 0%, #0A0F17 100%);
    padding:68px 32px 58px;
  }
  .page-banner::before{
    background-image:url("img/background-2.jpg");
    background-size:cover; background-position:center; background-repeat:no-repeat;
    mask-image:none;
  }
  .page-banner h1{font-size:44px;}
  @media (max-width:760px){
    .page-banner{padding:44px 20px 40px;}
    .page-banner h1{font-size:30px;}
  }
  @media (max-width:420px){
    .page-banner{padding:36px 16px 32px;}
    .page-banner h1{font-size:25px;}
  }
</style>


<section class="page-banner">
  <div class="page-banner-inner">
    <div class="eyebrow">EXPERT ENGINE CARE</div>
    <h1 class="display">ENGINE <span class="accent">REPAIR</span></h1>
    <p style="color:var(--off); font-size:16px; line-height:1.75; max-width:620px; margin:0 auto 20px;">Accurate diagnostics and honest engine repair for every make and model — genuine parts, skilled technicians, and no unnecessary work.</p>
    <div class="breadcrumb">
      <a href="index.html">Home</a>
      <span class="sep">»</span>
      <span class="current">Engine Repair</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="hybrid-section" style="padding-top:56px;">
  <div class="hybrid-inner">
    <div class="hybrid-panel">

      <div class="hybrid-header">
        <h2 class="display" style="letter-spacing:0.4px;">ENGINE PROBLEMS DIAGNOSED RIGHT, <span class="accent">FIXED RIGHT</span></h2>
      </div>

      <div class="hybrid-content">
        <div class="story-content" style="position:relative;">
          <p style="color:var(--muted); margin-bottom:16px;">A strange noise, a loss of power, a warning light on the dashboard — engine problems can be confusing and stressful. At Taqwa Automobile, we start every engine repair with a proper diagnosis, not guesswork, so you only pay for the work your car actually needs.</p>
          <p style="color:var(--muted);">From minor tune-ups to full engine overhauls, our technicians work on all major makes and models using genuine parts and the right tools for the job, so your engine runs smoothly for the long run.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="hybrid-illustration">
          <img src={base + "img/engine-repeir.jpg"} alt="Engine repair work at Taqwa Automobile" style="width:100%; height:auto; border-radius:6px;">
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="hybrid-grid" style="margin-top:30px; padding-top:28px; border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); position:relative;">

        <div class="svc-reason-item">
          <div class="svc-reason-num"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><circle cx="10" cy="10" r="6.5" stroke="#F97316" stroke-width="1.4"/><line x1="14.5" y1="14.5" x2="20" y2="20" stroke="#F97316" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"/><path d="M7 10h1.5l1-2 1.5 4 1-2H13" stroke="#F97316" stroke-width="1" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></div>
          <div>
            <h4>Accurate Diagnostics First</h4>
            <p>We pinpoint the real cause before touching a single part, so you avoid paying for repairs you don't actually need.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="svc-reason-item">
          <div class="svc-reason-num"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><rect x="3" y="7" width="15" height="10" rx="1.5" stroke="#F97316" stroke-width="1.4"/><rect x="18" y="10" width="2" height="4" fill="#F97316"/></svg></div>
          <div>
            <h4>Genuine Parts &amp; Fluids</h4>
            <p>We use genuine or manufacturer-approved parts and quality fluids, never generic substitutes that wear out fast.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="svc-reason-item">
          <div class="svc-reason-num"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M12 2l7 3v6c0 4.5-3 8-7 9-4-1-7-4.5-7-9V5l7-3z" stroke="#F97316" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linejoin="round"/><path d="M9 12l2 2 4-4" stroke="#F97316" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></div>
          <div>
            <h4>Skilled, Experienced Technicians</h4>
            <p>Our mechanics have years of hands-on experience across a wide range of engines, from everyday cars to commercial vehicles.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="svc-reason-item">
          <div class="svc-reason-num"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9" stroke="#F97316" stroke-width="1.5"/><path d="M8 12.5l2.5 2.5L16 9" stroke="#F97316" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></div>
          <div>
            <h4>Built for Long-Term Reliability</h4>
            <p>Our goal isn't just a quick fix — it's making sure your engine keeps running well long after you leave our workshop.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>

    </div>

    <div class="hybrid-features-strip">
      <div class="hf-item">
        <svg width="26" height="26" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10" fill="#F97316"/><path d="M8 12.5l2.5 2.5L16 9" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
        <span>Certified Engine Technicians</span>
      </div>
      <div class="hf-item">
        <svg width="26" height="26" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10" fill="#F97316"/><path d="M8 12.5l2.5 2.5L16 9" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
        <span>Computerized Diagnostics</span>
      </div>
      <div class="hf-item">
        <svg width="26" height="26" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10" fill="#F97316"/><path d="M8 12.5l2.5 2.5L16 9" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
        <span>Genuine Parts Only</span>
      </div>
      <div class="hf-item">
        <svg width="26" height="26" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10" fill="#F97316"/><path d="M8 12.5l2.5 2.5L16 9" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
        <span>Warranty on Repairs</span>
      </div>
      <div class="hf-item">
        <svg width="26" height="26" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10" fill="#F97316"/><path d="M8 12.5l2.5 2.5L16 9" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
        <span>No Hidden Charges</span>
      </div>
      <div class="hf-item">
        <svg width="26" height="26" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10" fill="#F97316"/><path d="M8 12.5l2.5 2.5L16 9" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
        <span>All Makes &amp; Models Welcome</span>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>

<section class="hybrid-process-section">
  <div class="hybrid-process-inner">
    <div class="hybrid-process-header">
      <h2 class="display" style="letter-spacing:0.4px;">OUR ENGINE <span class="accent">REPAIR PROCESS</span></h2>
      <p>From the first diagnostic scan to the final road test, every engine repair at Taqwa Automobile follows the same careful, honest process.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="hybrid-process-steps">

      <div class="hp-item">
        <div class="hp-num">01</div>
        <h3>Initial Diagnostic Scan</h3>
        <p>We run a computerized diagnostic scan to read fault codes and get a clear starting point for the problem.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="hp-item">
        <div class="hp-num">02</div>
        <h3>Detailed Inspection</h3>
        <p>Our technicians physically inspect the engine to confirm the diagnosis and check for any related issues.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="hp-item">
        <div class="hp-num">03</div>
        <h3>Transparent Quote &amp; Approval</h3>
        <p>We explain what's wrong in plain language and give you a clear quote before any repair work begins.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="hp-item">
        <div class="hp-num">04</div>
        <h3>Expert Repair Work</h3>
        <p>Our skilled mechanics carry out the repair using genuine parts and proper procedures for your engine type.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="hp-item">
        <div class="hp-num">05</div>
        <h3>Quality Testing &amp; Road Test</h3>
        <p>We test the repair thoroughly and take your car for a road test to confirm the problem is truly fixed.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="hp-item">
        <div class="hp-num">06</div>
        <h3>Warranty &amp; Follow-Up</h3>
        <p>We back our engine repairs with a service warranty and are here if you have any questions afterward.</p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="services-recap-section">
  <div class="services-recap-inner">
    <div class="services-recap-header">
      <h2 class="display" style="letter-spacing:0.4px;">OUR <span class="accent">ENGINE REPAIR SERVICES</span></h2>
    </div>

    <div class="services-grid">

      <div class="service-card">
        <div class="icon-panel">
          <svg width="56" height="56" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><circle cx="10" cy="10" r="6.5" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="1.4"/><line x1="14.5" y1="14.5" x2="20" y2="20" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"/><path d="M7 10h1.5l1-2 1.5 4 1-2H13" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="1" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div class="body">
          <h3>Engine Diagnostic Scan</h3>
          <p>Computerized scanning to read fault codes and identify the exact source of engine trouble.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="service-card">
        <div class="icon-panel">
          <svg width="56" height="56" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="1.4"/><path d="M12 7v5l3 3" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div class="body">
          <h3>Timing Belt &amp; Chain Replacement</h3>
          <p>Timely replacement to prevent costly engine damage from a worn or snapped timing belt.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="service-card">
        <div class="icon-panel">
          <svg width="56" height="56" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><rect x="3" y="7" width="15" height="10" rx="1.5" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="1.4"/><rect x="18" y="10" width="2" height="4" fill="#fff"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div class="body">
          <h3>Head Gasket Repair</h3>
          <p>Expert repair of blown or leaking head gaskets to stop overheating and oil or coolant loss.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="service-card">
        <div class="icon-panel">
          <svg width="56" height="56" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M12 2l7 3v6c0 4.5-3 8-7 9-4-1-7-4.5-7-9V5l7-3z" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linejoin="round"/><path d="M9 12l2 2 4-4" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div class="body">
          <h3>Engine Overhaul &amp; Rebuild</h3>
          <p>Complete engine rebuilds for high-mileage or heavily worn engines, restoring performance and reliability.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="service-card">
        <div class="icon-panel">
          <svg width="56" height="56" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M6 12h2l1.2-2.5L11 15l1.2-3h2.3" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/><rect x="3" y="7" width="15" height="10" rx="1.5" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="1.4"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div class="body">
          <h3>Oil &amp; Filter Change</h3>
          <p>Regular oil and filter changes using quality lubricants to keep your engine protected and running clean.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="service-card">
        <div class="icon-panel">
          <svg width="56" height="56" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M4 12a8 8 0 0113-6" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round"/><path d="M17 6l-1-3.5L20 4" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="1.3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/><path d="M20 12a8 8 0 01-13 6" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round"/><path d="M7 18l1 3.5L4 20" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="1.3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div class="body">
          <h3>Cooling System Repair</h3>
          <p>Radiator, water pump and thermostat repair to keep your engine from overheating.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="service-card">
        <div class="icon-panel">
          <svg width="56" height="56" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><rect x="6" y="6" width="12" height="12" rx="1.5" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="1.4"/><rect x="9.5" y="9.5" width="5" height="5" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="1.2"/><line x1="8" y1="2" x2="8" y2="6" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="1.2"/><line x1="16" y1="2" x2="16" y2="6" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="1.2"/><line x1="8" y1="18" x2="8" y2="22" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="1.2"/><line x1="16" y1="18" x2="16" y2="22" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="1.2"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div class="body">
          <h3>Fuel System Service</h3>
          <p>Cleaning and repair of injectors, fuel pumps and filters for smooth starts and better fuel efficiency.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="service-card">
        <div class="icon-panel">
          <svg width="56" height="56" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M2 12h4V6h4v12h4V6h4v12h4" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div class="body">
          <h3>Exhaust System Repair</h3>
          <p>Muffler, pipe and catalytic converter repair to fix noise, smoke and performance issues.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="why-choose-section">
  <div class="why-choose-inner">

    <div class="why-choose-content">
      <div class="eyebrow-line">Why Trust Us</div>
      <h2 class="display" style="letter-spacing:0.3px;">With Your <span class="accent">Engine Repair</span>?</h2>
      <p>Engine problems left undiagnosed only get worse and more expensive. Our workshop combines skilled technicians, genuine parts and honest diagnostics to fix it right the first time.</p>
      <a href="#contact" class="btn-learn">
        Book Your Engine Checkup
        <svg width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
      </a>
    </div>

    <div class="why-choose-grid">

      <div class="wc-card tech">
        <img src={base + "img/expert-technitian.jpg"} alt="Certified Engine Repair Technicians" style="position:absolute; inset:0; width:100%; height:100%; object-fit:cover; z-index:0;">
        <div class="wc-label">Certified Technicians</div>
      </div>

      <div class="wc-card tools">
        <img src={base + "img/car-parts.jpg"} alt="Genuine Engine Parts" style="position:absolute; inset:0; width:100%; height:100%; object-fit:cover; z-index:0;">
        <div class="wc-label">Genuine Parts</div>
      </div>

      <div class="wc-card parts">
        <img src={base + "img/Car-Diagnostics.jpg"} alt="Computerized Engine Diagnostics" style="position:absolute; inset:0; width:100%; height:100%; object-fit:cover; z-index:0;">
        <div class="wc-label">Computerized Diagnostics</div>
      </div>

      <div class="wc-card service">
        <img src={base + "img/Trusted-Service.jpg"} alt="Honest Engine Repair Service" style="position:absolute; inset:0; width:100%; height:100%; object-fit:cover; z-index:0;">
        <div class="wc-label">No Hidden Charges</div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="faq-section">
  <div class="faq-inner">
    <div class="faq-header">
      <h2 class="display" style="letter-spacing:0.4px;">ENGINE REPAIR <span class="accent">FAQ</span></h2>
    </div>

    <div class="faq-grid">
      <div class="faq-column">

        <div class="faq-item">
          <button class="faq-question">
            How do I know if my engine needs repair?
            <span class="faq-arrow" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-answer">
            <div class="faq-answer-inner">Warning signs include unusual noises, loss of power, excessive smoke, warning lights, or rough idling. If you notice any of these, it's best to get a diagnostic check right away.</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="faq-item">
          <button class="faq-question">
            Do you use genuine parts for engine repair?
            <span class="faq-arrow" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-answer">
            <div class="faq-answer-inner">Yes, we use genuine or manufacturer-approved parts for every repair, so your engine performs the way it's meant to and lasts longer.</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="faq-item">
          <button class="faq-question">
            How long does an engine repair take?
            <span class="faq-arrow" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-answer">
            <div class="faq-answer-inner">It depends on the issue — a minor repair may take a few hours, while a full engine overhaul can take a few days. We'll give you a clear timeline after diagnosis.</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="faq-item">
          <button class="faq-question">
            Is an engine overhaul the same as replacement?
            <span class="faq-arrow" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-answer">
            <div class="faq-answer-inner">No. An overhaul rebuilds and restores your existing engine's internal parts, while replacement means installing a different engine entirely. We'll recommend whichever makes more sense for your car and budget.</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="faq-item">
          <button class="faq-question">
            Do you offer warranty on engine repairs?
            <span class="faq-arrow" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-answer">
            <div class="faq-answer-inner">Yes, our engine repairs come with a service warranty. Ask our team for details specific to the work done on your vehicle.</div>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="about-cta-section" id="contact">
  <div class="about-cta-inner">
    <h2>Get Your Engine Running Smoothly Again</h2>
    <p>Book a diagnostic checkup or ask our specialists a question &mdash; call, message us on WhatsApp, or visit our workshop in Uttara.</p>
    <div class="about-cta-address">
      <svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M12 21s7-6.5 7-11.5a7 7 0 10-14 0C5 14.5 12 21 12 21z" stroke="#F97316" stroke-width="1.6"/><circle cx="12" cy="9.5" r="2.3" stroke="#F97316" stroke-width="1.6"/></svg>
      <span>Sector # 15, Block # C, Road # 3/A, Plot # 40, Diabari, Uttara, Dhaka.</span>
    </div>
    <div class="about-cta-actions">
      <a href="tel:+8801854226757" class="btn btn-red">
        <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M22 16.92v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.18 2 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-8.63-3.07 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-3.07-8.67A2 2 0 0 1 4.11 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.72c.127.96.361 1.903.7 2.81a2 2 0 0 1-.45 2.11L8.09 9.91a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.27-1.27a2 2 0 0 1 2.11-.45c.907.339 1.85.573 2.81.7A2 2 0 0 1 22 16.92z" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
        Call Now
      </a>
